Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.38,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(636.909,361.754)\fade(255,0,255,0,860,3860,4700)}Episode 33
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.38,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.949,559.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,860,3860,4700)}Gathering of Heroes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:37.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.221,499.304)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:44.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(952.833,474.94)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.98,0:00:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked Xuande into coming, \Nso why didn't you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yunchang is a tigerlike general...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He and Xuande are never apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.97,0:00:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I made an attempt, he could slay me with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The present enemy of Eastern Wu is Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If our alliance fell apart, \Nit would damage our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Liu Bei and Kongming are not eliminated, \Nthey will become a danger to Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Cao Cao has sent an envoy with a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,638.667)}"Commander Zhou, surrender!" \N- Great Chancellor of the Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag him out and behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, when nations are at war, envoys shouldn't be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.98,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do you imply I cannot kill a traitor's envoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out and display his head for all to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His blood will be our tribute! \NTomorrow, we march!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:14.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, spare my life! Spare my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Eastern Wu's vanguard, Gan Ning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:39.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(934.405,504)}Gān Níng \NStyled: Xīngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:46.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(942.283,464.83)}Cài Mào \NStyled: Déguī
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:03.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(933.086,478.667)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eastern Wu's forces are few, yet you were still defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All for your incompetence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Jing Province's navy has not been drilled recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Qing and Xu provincial soldiers are not suited for naval warfare, hence our defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We must establish a naval training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those from Qing, Xu, and Jing Provinces will be trained rigorously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Each day they will gain experience. They will be battle-ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the Commander of the Navy! \NCan't you act in your discretion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why even bother reporting this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously-!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing and Xingba, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, Xingba, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, the Cao navy is inexperienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so they have set up a naval training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the camp's lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:05:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Xingba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a colored ship without any insignia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring drums and arm the men with powerful crossbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to scout the enemy's naval camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We two could assess their strength on our own. Why must you go personally, Chief Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a colored ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's so vibrant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What type of boat is that? A merchant ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a spy ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform the Chancellor at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's not a spy ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor barely tolerates us Jing provincials to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The boats along the river are well-organized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Their navy is improving rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are the commanders of their naval force?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They have led the navy for a long time, \Nand are skilled in naval warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we get rid of those two first, defeating Cao Cao will be easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfurl the sails! Back to camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That Zhou the Youth spied on our naval camp! When we went after them, they withdrew!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That insolent Zhou the Youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, he won a battle, \Nfrustrating our troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he spies on our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What strategy can be used to counter him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, your subject, Jiang Gan, is willing to go to Jiangdong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:32.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(440.649,485.333)}Jiǎng Gàn \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,... and persuade Zhou the Youth to submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, are you and Zhou Gongjin friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was young, we were fellow students and intimate friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use my powers of persuasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain I can convince Zhou the Youth \Nto lay down arms and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, what will you need when you cross the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one page boy and two servants, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Bring wine for Ziyi to take along.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:14.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, a man who claims to be your \Nold friend, Jiang Gan, wishes to visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A mouthpiece has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, I hope you've been well since we last met.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, you crossed stormy waves and strong winds without hesitation to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you've come to speak on behalf of the Cao clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.58,0:11:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been apart for so long, I have truly missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I came to reminisce about the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you suspect me of coming as an envoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that you do not welcome old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,One need not be a master of music like Shi Kuang of old...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:44.90,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Shi Kuang ({\fnYu Gothic}师旷{\fn}) was a famous music master and early humanist from the Jin state who specialized in the Qin-zither, during the Spring and Autumn period.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,... to hear and understand the meaning of a sweet song.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you treat old friends like this, I should just take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you aren't here on his behalf, then why leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, your eloquence is famous throughout the realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so I worried you had come to persuade me to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you aren't here on his behalf, \NI'll treat you as an old friend again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread the order!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All officers are to gather in the main tent! \NI shall hold a banquet to welcome Ziyi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Jiang is my old classmate and a good friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Though he came from the north, \Nhe is not here as Cao Cao's envoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you all not to be suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Taishi Ci!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:12:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Present!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I award you the sword of command \Nduring this feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's banquet is a gathering for old friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for camaraderie, so no talk of politics!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who speaks of military affairs will be executed without pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:17.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.183,490.667)}Tàishǐ Cí \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, I haven't had a drop of wine since I took command.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But with old friends gathered today, I may drink without worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, let's have a toast together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, come follow me outside the tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As you desire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, I remember that when we were classmates,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,your eloquence was often praised by our teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that when you debated the scholars of Jianghuai, none could best you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you flatter me too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity, what a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it a pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, look at the men of my tent, are they not powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, you are a master of bears and tigers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, look at my navy, aren't they mighty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mighty indeed, and unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my provisions, aren't they plentiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You indeed have elite troops and abundant supplies! Your reputation is well-deserved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, when we were classmates, \Ndid you ever imagine we'd meet like this today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, with your talent this is neither unexpected nor unearned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a great man finds a worthy lord to serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}he grows to know his lord intimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667}Outwardly minister and lord are professional, \Nbut inwardly they are close as kinsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}He listens and follows the minister's plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}sharing disaster or fortune, glory or disgrace,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}with the same mind and virtue, working together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}That... is how Zhou Yu does things!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord9.546}Even if the eloquent Su Qin \Nand Zhang Yi returned from the dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:10.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Sū Qín and Zhāng Yí were rival political strategists and diplomats of the Warring States period.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667}their words a rushing torrent, \Ntheir tongues as sharp as steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}my heart would never be unswayed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These great generals are all heroes of Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This meeting can be called a meeting of heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A meeting of heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,More wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, though we drink, we need entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I perform a sword dance and sing us a merry song?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. Good idea, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:27.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}A true man walks on this earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:31.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}to make his name the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:36.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}And when he's done his best,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:40.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}in peace he can make his rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:44.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a man has made his rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.38,0:19:48.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}he will quaff wine with zest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:52.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a man's drunk as drunk can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:20:00.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}He sings a madman's litany!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:10.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}A true man walks on this earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:13.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}to make his name the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:16.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}And when he's done his best,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}in peace he can make his rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:22.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a man has made his rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}he will quaff wine with zest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:28.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a man's drunk as drunk can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}He sings a madman's litany!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:34.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a man has made his rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:37.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}he will quaff wine with zest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:40.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}When a man's drunk as drunk can be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:50.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}He sings a madman's litany!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.14,0:21:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,have you really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really not here to convince me to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, we were classmates and dear friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't see through your plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to get me to surrender to the Cao clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I couldn't see it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly came to meet with my old friend again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.82,0:22:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to forget our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.66,0:22:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cannot believe me- then I shall put my life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.86,0:22:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,do with me as you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've lost my temper after drinking, I hope you can forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Have three more rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I already had too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi, we have been apart for many years!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we sleep together on the same bed,\N like when we were classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.34,0:23:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you are busy with military affairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.38,0:23:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I should not overstay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like brothers! What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.82,0:24:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today was the meeting of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.02,0:24:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've enjoyed it together, \Nso let us now retire together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell! Farewell! Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.30,0:25:59.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,589.333)}"Message to the Marquis of Wu."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}Cao Cao is like a ravenous tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}Though he is the Chancellor of Han, he is a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667}General, you have divine strength, and possess your family's ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\}You control Jiangdong, \Nyour domain stretches 1,000{\i1} li,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.26,0:26:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667}with elite troops, ample supplies, and heroic commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}This is the time for conquest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.70,0:26:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667\pos(640,677.333)}It is time to cleanse the Han Dynasty of this evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.667}This is our chance to replace these rotten foundations!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.98,0:27:11.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,633.333)}"From Cai Mao and Zhang Yun."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:29.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,To the Chief Commander of Eastern Wu, Gongjin:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.30,0:27:31.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We surrendered not for wealth, \Nbut due to Cao's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.74,0:27:34.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We claim to train the soldiers, \Nso as to keep them in camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.22,0:27:37.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When we get the chance, we'll present Cao Cao's head to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.06,0:27:40.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,We will be in contact. \NHave faith in us, this is our humble reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.14,0:27:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun pay our respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.90,0:28:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.58,0:28:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.10,0:28:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, are you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.90,0:28:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few days, I'll have you see traitor Cao's head...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, whose head will you show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...The traitor Cao Cao's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.78,0:28:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will you take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.18,0:28:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.62,0:29:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.74,0:29:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is in my bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At the feast, sir, you got drunk and asked Jiang Gan to sleep with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.66,0:29:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.18,0:29:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't normally get so drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, I may have made some mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.86,0:29:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have been talking in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, someone from the north has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.38,0:30:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.62,0:30:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.58,0:30:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is so pressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.66,0:30:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Commanders Cai and Zhang are still facing some difficulties in their task-
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.78,0:31:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Ziyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.06,0:31:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately Ziyi is in a drunken slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:39.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Gongjin is a very careful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.34,0:32:45.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,If he finds a letter is missing in the morning, won't I be in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.58,0:32:48.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Ah, I must leave at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.90,0:33:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.98,0:33:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you, Master Jiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.46,0:33:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.50,0:33:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that I am bothering the Chief Commander, so I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.54,0:33:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.66,0:33:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell! Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.26,0:33:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.06,0:33:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail! Set sail now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.18,0:33:45.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.608,501.333)}Zhūgé Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has invited you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.42,0:34:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.46,0:34:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu was generous and noble, \Nmoreover he was clever and careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.26,0:34:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,None of my words could sway him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.46,0:34:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan was a failure, \Nand we end up looking like fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.14,0:34:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, although I was unable to persuade Zhou Yu,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.66,0:34:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I did find important information for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.02,0:35:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.58,0:35:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those despicable traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.06,0:35:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you should decide upon this quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wait, there may be problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.78,0:35:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.54,0:35:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.10,0:35:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your orders, Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.46,0:35:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Cai Mao and Zhang Yun!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.06,0:35:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.90,0:36:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.54,0:36:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.70,0:36:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to march to Sanjiangkou \Nat once and attack Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.86,0:37:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, our naval forces aren't ready yet! Please don't be hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I would sit idly by,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.62,0:37:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,while you two train my own Navy to bring my head to Zhou Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.78,0:37:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.38,0:37:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.18,0:37:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Behead them!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.02,0:37:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.70,0:37:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! We are innocent, we swear! Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.78,0:37:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Bring them back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth, you bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.26,0:38:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.90,0:38:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao and Zhang Yun are surrendered generals, and thus served with half a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.74,0:38:26.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(857.834,505.333)}Xún Yōu \NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.54,0:38:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Their deaths today may prevent future problems. So it is ultimately favorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.90,0:38:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why did you execute Cai Mao and Zhang Yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.98,0:38:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two led surrendered Jing Province troops, but were careless and neglected military law,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.66,0:38:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so I had them put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.02,0:38:56.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296.576,509.333)}Xú Shù \NStyled: Yuánzhí
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.58,0:39:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we are still training the navy, \Nso we should appoint new people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.22,0:39:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mao Jie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.98,0:39:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.46,0:39:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Jin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.94,0:39:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.54,0:39:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you two to replace them as Commanders of the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.98,0:39:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.26,0:39:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Comment: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:28.38,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When Man walks this earth,
Comment: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:32.58,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he strives for worth!
Comment: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:37.02,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When he strives for worth,
Comment: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:41.02,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}life is at an ease!
Comment: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:45.34,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When life is at an eased,
Comment: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:49.50,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he is nigh drunk!
Comment: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:53.94,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When he is nigh drunk,
Comment: 0,0:19:53.94,0:20:01.82,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}utters he a mad litany!
Comment: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.30,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When Man walks this earth,
Comment: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:14.38,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he strives for worth!
Comment: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:17.54,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When he strives for worth,
Comment: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:15.90,Default,All,0,0,0,,Great!
Comment: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:20.46,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}life is at an ease!
Comment: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:23.62,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}when life is at an ease!
Comment: 0,0:20:23.62,0:20:26.26,Thinking,Singer,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he is nigh drunk!
